     "code": "from collections import Counter\ndef spec(xs):\n    ys = sorted(set(xs))\n    return all(ys[i] <= ys[i + 1] for i in range(len(ys) - 1)) and Counter(ys) == Counter(xs)\ngen = lambda rng: [rng.randint(0, 9) for _ in range(rng.randint(0, 8))]\nr = for_all(spec, gen, lambda xs: shrink_list(xs, shrink_int), trials=200, seed=0)\nassert r is not None and r[0] == 1, r\nassert r[1] == [6, 0, 4, 8, 7, 6], r\nassert r[2] == [6, 6], r\n"
